# Dangerous paths (decision D-07, amended 2026-10-09): a PR that changes any path matching a line below
# gets a warning comment asking to talk it through with Theo before merging. It never blocks the merge.
# Read by .github/workflows/dangerous-paths.yml.
# One glob per line: "**" matches across folders, "*" within one folder; case is ignored. Lines starting
# with "#" are comments. The warning always reads this file from the PR's base branch, so a change here
# applies to the PRs after it, not to itself.

# Database: migrations, access rules and their tests.
supabase/**

# CI, deploy and this warning.
.github/**

# Third-party code served with the site (copied as it is from public/ since P1-09d; src/vendor/ before).
public/vendor/**

# Which database the site talks to (public/ since P1-09d; src/db/ before).
public/kc-config.js

# The escaping helper. Uncomment when P0-19 creates it.
src/ui/shared/kc-safe.js

# Dependencies and the scripts that run the tests (from P1-01a).
package.json
package-lock.json

# The test harness: the Claude Code hooks and settings, the tool settings, the Node pin, the test run's own
# checks, the ratchet, the harness's self-test (P1-01b), the balance matrix's code (P1-02) and the script that
# posts its report (P1-03a), and the build that makes the site every test opens (P1-05). Loosening any of
# them should be seen. Some files don't exist yet (dependency-cruiser, knip): listed so they're covered from the
# start. The balance baselines (tests/balance/baseline/) aren't listed: CI's balance job checks them, so a pull
# request that changes play isn't flagged for its data.
.claude/**
tsconfig*.json
vitest.config.*
playwright.config.*
eslint.config.*
.dependency-cruiser.*
knip.*
.nvmrc
.npmrc
tests/setup/**
tests/legacy.test.ts
tests/ratchet.json
tests/static/harness.test.ts
tests/balance/*.ts
tools/balance/**
tools/github/**
tools/hooks/**
tools/check.*
tools/build.*
tools/ratchet.*
# The engine's loader (it bundles the engine for the tests, P1-09d), which files make each page (the build's checks
# and the balance runner's read it), and the dev server (it must never reach the live database).
tests/lib/engine.ts
tools/pages.*
tools/dev.*
